  "name": "Submersion",
  "description": "Press your Secondary Ability key to empower your attacks for 10 seconds. Hits apply Submersion for 5 seconds, forcing the target downward and heavily suppressing underwater movement; repeated hits extend the effect by 5 seconds, up to 1 minute.\n \nUnmarked non-aquatic targets also have their air rapidly drained and begin drowning once it is exhausted, whether they are underwater or on land. Aquatic Origins are immune to the air-drain/drowning portion but are still pulled downward. Kelp-marked Selkies and Nereids are also hydrated by each hit through their own native hydration systems. Marked non-aquatic allies remain protected from the hostile effect."
